{"articleNo":"103539","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=103539&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2014 터키정부초청장학생 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.03.12","hit":"3011","attachments":[{"name":"터키정부초청장학생모집.zip","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=103539&attachNo=73400"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014 터키정부초청장학생 모집 요강</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 모집 분야: 석사 및 박사과정</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 지원 자격: 해당 지원 자격 소지자(졸업예정자 포함)로서, </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-석사과정: 만 30세 미만 (1984. 1. 1 기준)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-박사과정: 만 35세 미만 (1979. 1. 1 기준)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 지원 분야: 자연과학, 기계, 기술, 터키어, 이슬람 신학 등 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 지원 기간 및 방법 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-지원 마감: 2014. 3. 31 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-웹 사이트 접속 (첨부2 참조)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-지원서, 사진 등을 인터넷으로 접수</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-영어, 불어, 독일어 등의 어학 자격 첨부</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-GRE, GMAT 점수 제출 요망</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-자격 요건 및 인터뷰 종합하여 장학생 선정 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">※상세한 내용은 웹 사이트 참조 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 장학금 내역</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-석사과정 월 USD 375 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-박사과정 월 USD 500 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-학비: 무료</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-어학연수 1년 무료 제공</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-기숙사 제공</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-왕복 항공권 등</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">※상세한 내용은 첨부 문서2 웹 사이트 참조 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 제출 서류</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-지원서 (On-line)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-졸업증명서(학사, 석사)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-성적증명서(학사, 석사)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-여권 사본 혹은, 주민등록초본(영문)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-여권 사진</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">※모든 서류는 영어 혹은, 터키어로 작성하며 합격자는 원본 서류 송부 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">7. 기타 사항</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-장학금 내용과 지원 방법에 대해서는 첨부2 참조</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-웹 사이트 접속하여 개인별로 서류 제출 및 지원함.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-통상 전화 인터뷰를 실시하며, 개인 메일로 결과를 통보함.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">-장학생으로 선발될 경우 터키 정부의 안내에 따라 출국하며 상세한 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">유학 및 생활 정보를 수집하여 현지 사정에 철저히 대비해야 함. </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 1.2014터키정부초청장학생 모집안내 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FO